    <div class="notbox">
      <h3>What this is not</h3>
      <p>Not a content mill, and not a template with your name dropped in. Not my theology under your byline. Not a machine writing a book nobody said out loud. Every chapter starts with your words, in your voice, and you approve every line before it prints. If a sentence isn't something you would say from the front of the room, it doesn't go in.</p>
