      <h2 class="section-title">Three steps. Ninety days.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Most of your time is talking. Most of mine is writing, editing, and making it look like a real book. We meet by video. You never have to sit in front of a blank page.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step"><b>1</b><div><h4>A first call</h4><p>Twenty minutes. What the book is, what you already have, and whether we're a fit. If it isn't a fit I'll tell you, and I'll tell you what I'd do instead.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><b>2</b><div><h4>We draw it out</h4><p>Your sermons, notes, or outlines go in. If you have nothing written, we record a few conversations and that becomes the raw material. I build the outline with you, then write each chapter in your voice, and you read every one.</p></div></div>
      <div class="step"><b>3</b><div><h4>It ships</h4><p>We edit together. I handle the interior, the cover, and the Amazon setup, under your own account, so the royalties and the rights are yours from the first day. Then we tell people.</p></div></div>
